{"questionId":"u13-s005-v001","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-solving","skillId":"quadratic-square-root-method","lockedSkillOrder":5,"difficulty":"basic","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"解 x²=49。","givenConditions":"實數範圍。","target":"求平方方程式的根","choices":["x=7 或 x=-7","x=7","x=-7","x=49 或 x=-49"],"answerIndex":0,"explanation":"x²＝49 表示尋找所有平方後等於 49 的實數。7² 與 (－7)² 都是 49，因此開平方要寫 x＝±√49＝±7，完整解為 x＝7 或－7。 選項中的四十九與負四十九平方後數值過大，而只列七或只列負七都遺漏另一個合法分支。","steps":["確認右端四十九為正數。","開平方寫成 x＝±√49。","化簡並代回，確認 7 與－7 的平方都為四十九。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"x=7 或 x=-7","truth":true,"reason":"平方等於正數 49 有正負兩個平方根。"},{"choice":"x=7","truth":false,"reason":"漏掉負平方根。"},{"choice":"x=-7","truth":false,"reason":"漏掉正平方根。"},{"choice":"x=49 或 x=-49","truth":false,"reason":"沒有開平方。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"把主平方根 √49 的單一值七，誤當成方程式的全部解。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-discriminant"],"estimatedTimeSec":45,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"± 兩根均需保留。","difficultyReason":"最基本平方根解法。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"求平方方程式的根","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"30141e9e2c567a88d0ea07fbba9eb00e4463a531d70d31e5942d369670b6b8c6"}
{"questionId":"u13-s005-v002","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-solving","skillId":"quadratic-square-root-method","lockedSkillOrder":5,"difficulty":"basic","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"解 (x-3)²=16。","givenConditions":"實數範圍。","target":"解平移平方方程式","choices":["x=4 或 x=-4","x=19 或 x=-13","x=7 或 x=-1","x=3±16"],"answerIndex":2,"explanation":"把括號 x－3 視為整體，開平方得 x－3＝±4。兩支分別加 3，得到 x＝7 與 x＝－1；代回時括號值為 4、－4，平方皆為 16。 七與負一代入時，x－3 分別為四與負四，平方都等於十六；其他選項沒有完成括號位移。","steps":["由 (x－3)²＝16 得 x－3＝4 或－4。","兩個分支都加三，求得 x＝7、－1。","代回原式，確認兩個括號值平方皆為十六。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"x=4 或 x=-4","truth":false,"reason":"忘記括號位移 3。"},{"choice":"x=19 或 x=-13","truth":false,"reason":"把 16 當平方根。"},{"choice":"x=7 或 x=-1","truth":true,"reason":"x-3=±4，再加 3。"},{"choice":"x=3±16","truth":false,"reason":"未開平方。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"把 ±4 直接當成 x，忘記還要把括號中的位移三解回去。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-discriminant"],"estimatedTimeSec":55,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"兩根皆合法。","difficultyReason":"基本括號位移。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"解平移平方方程式","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"6ce09e2e2604007d9ed9fc4f46e46665c3fa70a09692c1ad440ab15f3913620e"}
{"questionId":"u13-s005-v003","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-solving","skillId":"quadratic-square-root-method","lockedSkillOrder":5,"difficulty":"basic","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"解 (2x+1)²=9。","givenConditions":"2 非 0。","target":"處理括號內一次係數","choices":["x=3 或 x=-3","x=1 或 x=-2","x=2 或 x=-1","x=4 或 x=-2"],"answerIndex":1,"explanation":"開平方後 2x＋1＝3 或－3。第一支給 2x＝2，x＝1；第二支給 2x＝－4，x＝－2。兩值代回括號分別得到 3、－3，平方都為 9。 正一與負二各自讓 2x＋1 等於正三、負三，因此平方皆為九；兩支都不可因外觀相似而刪除。","steps":["把 2x＋1 視為整體，列 2x＋1＝±3。","分別解兩個一次方程式，得 x＝1、－2。","代回檢查括號值為正三或負三。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"x=3 或 x=-3","truth":false,"reason":"把括號整體當 x。"},{"choice":"x=1 或 x=-2","truth":true,"reason":"2x+1=±3，分別解得 1、-2。"},{"choice":"x=2 或 x=-1","truth":false,"reason":"解一次方程式時位移錯。"},{"choice":"x=4 或 x=-2","truth":false,"reason":"正分支忘記除以 2。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"開平方後未把常數一移項並除以二，錯把 ±3 當成 x。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-discriminant"],"estimatedTimeSec":65,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"分支各自解。","difficultyReason":"含係數的平方根解法。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"處理括號內一次係數","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"12c1e93b2d6f9422f45e62e16f4254828531ba9bc484a4b7378b540eb70ee32e"}
{"questionId":"u13-s005-v004","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-solving","skillId":"quadratic-square-root-method","lockedSkillOrder":5,"difficulty":"standard","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"x²=-4 在實數範圍的解為何？","givenConditions":"限定實數範圍。","target":"判斷負常數平方方程式","choices":["x=2","x=-2","x=±2","沒有實數解"],"answerIndex":3,"explanation":"任何實數 x 的平方都大於或等於零，不可能等於－4，因此在實數範圍沒有解。±2 的平方都是正 4，並不能滿足右端的負號。","steps":["辨認左邊是實數的平方。","使用 x²≥0 與右端－4＜0 比較。","判定無實數解，並排除 ±2 這些平方為正四的選項。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"x=2","truth":false,"reason":"2²=4，不是 -4。"},{"choice":"x=-2","truth":false,"reason":"(-2)²=4。"},{"choice":"x=±2","truth":false,"reason":"兩者平方都為正 4。"},{"choice":"沒有實數解","truth":true,"reason":"實數平方必為非負，不可能等於 -4。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"忽略右端負號，直接把四開平方寫成正負二。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-discriminant"],"estimatedTimeSec":50,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"不引入複數。","difficultyReason":"概念判斷而非運算。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"判斷負常數平方方程式","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"c5bd326f1fc29118efd9c13ede602d144a2354283367a18b3090b9b75596151d"}
{"questionId":"u13-s005-v005","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-solving","skillId":"quadratic-square-root-method","lockedSkillOrder":5,"difficulty":"standard","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"解 5(x-2)²=45。","givenConditions":"除數 5 非 0。","target":"解含平方外係數的方程式","choices":["x=3 或 x=-3","x=11 或 x=-7","x=5 或 x=-1","x=7 或 x=-3"],"answerIndex":2,"explanation":"先將平方外的係數隔離，兩邊除以 5 得 (x－2)²＝9。開平方後 x－2＝±3，再加 2 得 x＝5 或－1；兩值代回都使左邊等於 45。 把五與負一代回時，x－2 分別為三與負三，五倍平方都等於四十五，驗證完整解集。","steps":["方程式兩邊同除以五，隔離完全平方。","開平方得 x－2＝3 或－3。","解得 x＝5、－1，並代回原式驗算。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"x=3 或 x=-3","truth":false,"reason":"忘記加回 2。"},{"choice":"x=11 或 x=-7","truth":false,"reason":"直接以 ±9 處理括號。"},{"choice":"x=5 或 x=-1","truth":true,"reason":"先除以 5 得 (x-2)²=9，再開平方。"},{"choice":"x=7 或 x=-3","truth":false,"reason":"平方外係數處理錯。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"未先除以平方外係數五，或把 x－2＝±3 當成最後答案。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-discriminant"],"estimatedTimeSec":75,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"精確整數根。","difficultyReason":"多一步整體除法。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"解含平方外係數的方程式","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"490a6ab47ae461fc94e5a524aeaf4b107b90e1a7e11451a8507857e9588f2295"}
{"questionId":"u13-s005-v006","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-solving","skillId":"quadratic-square-root-method","lockedSkillOrder":5,"difficulty":"standard","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"解 (x+4)²=7。","givenConditions":"7>0。","target":"求無理根","choices":["x=-4±√7","x=4±√7","x=-4±7","x=±√3"],"answerIndex":0,"explanation":"右端 7 為正，開平方得 x＋4＝±√7；兩支同減 4，得到 x＝－4±√7。根號七不能化成整數，且正負號只作用在根式部分。 兩根以負四為中心、相距根號七，符合原完全平方的對稱性；正四開頭的選項位移方向相反。","steps":["把 x＋4 視為整體，寫 x＋4＝±√7。","兩個分支都減四，得到 x＝－4±√7。","將兩根代回，確認括號平方都等於七。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"x=-4±√7","truth":true,"reason":"開平方得 x+4=±√7，再減 4。"},{"choice":"x=4±√7","truth":false,"reason":"位移符號反。"},{"choice":"x=-4±7","truth":false,"reason":"未開平方。"},{"choice":"x=±√3","truth":false,"reason":"錯誤合併 7 與 4。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"把括號位移符號寫反成正四，或錯把 √7 當成七。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-discriminant"],"estimatedTimeSec":70,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"√7 已最簡。","difficultyReason":"基本無理平方根。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"求無理根","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"c232911a6c42b907ad0dc3e6cb3902ba565bf740f9cb048dbe13b89c30bfef2c"}
{"questionId":"u13-s005-v007","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-solving","skillId":"quadratic-square-root-method","lockedSkillOrder":5,"difficulty":"advanced","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"在不展開括號的前提下，解 4(x-1)²=3。","givenConditions":"實數範圍。","target":"化簡含分數的平方根","choices":["x=1±√3","x=1±3/4","x=(1±√3)/2","x=1±√3/2"],"answerIndex":3,"explanation":"先除以 4 得 (x－1)²＝3/4，再開平方為 x－1＝±√3/2。兩支加 1 後，x＝1±√3/2；分母二只屬於根式項，不是把整個 1±√3 再除以二。 將兩根減一後得到正負根號三除以二，平方皆為四分之三，再乘四恰好回到三。","steps":["兩邊同除以四，得到 (x－1)²＝3/4。","開平方並化簡 √(3/4)＝√3/2。","兩支同加一，得 x＝1±√3/2。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"x=1±√3","truth":false,"reason":"忘記平方外的 4。"},{"choice":"x=1±3/4","truth":false,"reason":"把平方根改成分數。"},{"choice":"x=(1±√3)/2","truth":false,"reason":"分母錯誤作用到位移 1。"},{"choice":"x=1±√3/2","truth":true,"reason":"先除以 4，或把 2(x-1)=±√3，均得相同結果。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"把 √(3/4) 寫成 √3/4，或誤讓分母二涵蓋常數一。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-discriminant"],"estimatedTimeSec":105,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"答案需區分 1±√3/2 與 (1±√3)/2。","difficultyReason":"分數線範圍精細。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"化簡含分數的平方根","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"89ca20bdba1cd8e894c91127fe745c1f39db6b8c16498f604d173d21b22420ae"}
{"questionId":"u13-s005-v008","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-solving","skillId":"quadratic-square-root-method","lockedSkillOrder":5,"difficulty":"advanced","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"解 (x-2)²=(x+1)²。","givenConditions":"兩邊平方皆有定義。","target":"解兩平方相等的方程式","choices":["x=-3/2","x=1/2","x=2 或 x=-1","所有實數"],"answerIndex":1,"explanation":"兩個平方相等表示 x－2＝x＋1 或 x－2＝－(x＋1)。第一支化簡成－2＝1，無解；第二支給 2x＝1，所以唯一根為 x＝1/2。 代入二分之一後兩括號為負三分之二與正三分之二，平方相同；其餘選項代入不具此相反數關係。","steps":["由 A²＝B² 列出 A＝B 或 A＝－B。","檢查 x－2＝x＋1 得矛盾，故此支無解。","解 x－2＝－x－1，得到 x＝1/2 並代回。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"x=-3/2","truth":false,"reason":"一次式移項錯誤。"},{"choice":"x=1/2","truth":true,"reason":"兩平方相等時 x-2=±(x+1)；正分支矛盾，負分支得 2x=1。"},{"choice":"x=2 或 x=-1","truth":false,"reason":"把兩邊分別設為 0。"},{"choice":"所有實數","truth":false,"reason":"兩個平方並非恆等。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"只列同號分支便誤判無解，或把兩邊平方直接約去而漏負號分支。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-discriminant"],"estimatedTimeSec":120,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"其中一個分支為矛盾，不產生根。","difficultyReason":"需轉為正負分支或平方差。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"解兩平方相等的方程式","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"07440f46f1f0b9a1b8e5d32a4a1a320a29a046f112371c2ae7ff8ca7f3f7ebfc"}
{"questionId":"u13-s005-v009","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-solving","skillId":"quadratic-square-root-method","lockedSkillOrder":5,"difficulty":"advanced","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"方程式 (3x-2)²=0 的實根為何？","givenConditions":"右側為 0。","target":"求重平方根","choices":["x=2/3","x=-2/3","x=2 或 x=-2","x=0"],"answerIndex":0,"explanation":"平方等於零時，括號本身只能等於零，因此 3x－2＝0，解得 3x＝2、x＝2/3。正負零是同一數，不會產生兩個相異根。 因右端為零，正負平方根兩支實際都等於零並合併；所以解集合不能寫出兩個不同數值。","steps":["由 (3x－2)²＝0 判定 3x－2＝0。","移項並除以三，求得 x＝2/3。","代回括號得零，確認只有一個相異實根。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"x=2/3","truth":true,"reason":"平方為 0 時括號內必為 0。"},{"choice":"x=-2/3","truth":false,"reason":"移項符號錯。"},{"choice":"x=2 或 x=-2","truth":false,"reason":"把係數 3 忽略並誤作 ±。"},{"choice":"x=0","truth":false,"reason":"只看右邊為 0。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"看到平方便寫 ±2/3，或把括號等於零直接解成 x＝0。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-discriminant"],"estimatedTimeSec":70,"unitCheck":"本題沒有需要換算的物理單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"只有一個相異根。","difficultyReason":"重根與分數解。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"authoringIntent":"求重平方根","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"2502493bef5fe231e7790cc35702972640cfaf3519c8f467fe195697c5db6e01"}
{"questionId":"u13-s005-v010","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-solving","skillId":"quadratic-square-root-method","lockedSkillOrder":5,"difficulty":"literacy","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"圓形標誌的半徑 r≥0 滿足 (r+1)²=81。r 為何？","givenConditions":"r≥0。","target":"求幾何可接受半徑","choices":["-10","9","8","80"],"answerIndex":2,"explanation":"由 (r＋1)²＝81 得 r＋1＝±9，所以代數候選為 r＝8、－10。半徑必須滿足 r≥0，負十不具幾何意義，因此半徑只能是 8。 半徑八代回時 r＋1＝9，平方為八十一；九只是括號值而非半徑，八十則混淆平方與加法。","steps":["開平方列 r＋1＝9 或－9。","分別減一，得到 r＝8、－10。","依半徑非負條件排除－10，保留 8。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"-10","truth":false,"reason":"是代數根但半徑不可為負。"},{"choice":"9","truth":false,"reason":"忘記減 1。"},{"choice":"8","truth":true,"reason":"r+1=±9，得 8、-10；半徑只取 8。"},{"choice":"80","truth":false,"reason":"把平方關係誤作相減。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"只寫正分支卻未說明半徑限制，或沒有排除負十。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-discriminant"],"estimatedTimeSec":90,"unitCheck":"r 使用題目標誌的長度單位。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"半徑負值不合理。","difficultyReason":"平方根解法與幾何定義域。","literacyContextNecessity":"此情境資訊不可刪除且會改變答案，因為半徑非負條件決定唯一可用根。","authoringIntent":"求幾何可接受半徑","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"3c8761efb75cd66b7afd199f55da657390f2f59517480228192622659a4f2a30"}
{"questionId":"u13-s005-v011","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-solving","skillId":"quadratic-square-root-method","lockedSkillOrder":5,"difficulty":"literacy","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"某機台時間 t 滿足 (t-12)²=25，且只在 0≤t≤15 分鐘內運作。可接受的 t 為何？","givenConditions":"0 與 15 都包含。","target":"求運作區間內時間","choices":["17 分鐘","7 分鐘","12 分鐘","7 或 17 分鐘"],"answerIndex":1,"explanation":"開平方得 t－12＝±5，所以兩個代數候選為 t＝17、7。機台只在 0≤t≤15 分鐘內運作，17 超出上限，7 位於區間內，故可接受時間為 7 分鐘。 七分鐘代回時與十二的差為負五，平方仍是二十五；區間篩選不會把中心值十二自動變成解。","steps":["由平方等式求得 t－12＝5 或－5。","解出候選 t＝17、7。","逐一套用 0≤t≤15，排除十七分鐘。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"17 分鐘","truth":false,"reason":"超出 15 分鐘。"},{"choice":"7 分鐘","truth":true,"reason":"代數根為 7、17，只有 7 在運作區間。"},{"choice":"12 分鐘","truth":false,"reason":"是平方中心，不是根。"},{"choice":"7 或 17 分鐘","truth":false,"reason":"未套用運作區間。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"求出兩個時間後未檢查運作區間，錯把十七分鐘也保留。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-discriminant"],"estimatedTimeSec":95,"unitCheck":"t 單位為分鐘。","roundingCheck":"全程使用精確值，不需四捨五入。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"17 必須排除。","difficultyReason":"兩根與區間篩選。","literacyContextNecessity":"此情境資訊不可刪除且會改變答案，因為機台運作區間是決定可接受時間的必要資料。","authoringIntent":"求運作區間內時間","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"501e8d88d85fc96a6fd0002c96bd030d23e8bd8aa14832afc2cacfeb68d685d0"}
{"questionId":"u13-s005-v012","unitId":"u13","numericUnitId":13,"topicId":"u13-solving","skillId":"quadratic-square-root-method","lockedSkillOrder":5,"difficulty":"literacy","type":"mc","sourceScope":"TAIWAN_CAP_JUNIOR_HIGH_MATH","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"text":"材料厚度 d（毫米）滿足 (d-4)²=0.09。可能厚度為何？","givenConditions":"厚度為正，兩值皆合理。","target":"求公差兩側厚度","choices":["3.91 mm 或 4.09 mm","3 mm 或 5 mm","只有 4.3 mm","3.7 mm 或 4.3 mm"],"answerIndex":3,"explanation":"0.09＝0.3²，所以 d－4＝±0.3。兩支分別加 4，得到 d＝4.3 mm 與 3.7 mm；兩個厚度都為正，代回後平方差都等於 0.09。 三點七與四點三毫米相對中心四對稱，各相差零點三；其他選項的差平方都不是零點零九。","steps":["計算 √0.09＝0.3，寫 d－4＝±0.3。","兩個分支都加四，得到 d＝4.3、3.7。","附上 mm 並代回確認平方為 0.09。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"3.91 mm 或 4.09 mm","truth":false,"reason":"把 √0.09 錯算成 0.09。"},{"choice":"3 mm 或 5 mm","truth":false,"reason":"把 √0.09 錯算成 1。"},{"choice":"只有 4.3 mm","truth":false,"reason":"漏掉負偏差分支。"},{"choice":"3.7 mm 或 4.3 mm","truth":true,"reason":"√0.09=0.3，所以 d=4±0.3。"}],"misconceptionTarget":"把 0.09 的平方根誤寫成 0.09，或只保留正號分支。","prerequisiteSkillIds":["quadratic-discriminant"],"estimatedTimeSec":95,"unitCheck":"d 與偏差均以毫米表示。","roundingCheck":"0.09 的平方根精確為 0.3，不需近似。","ambiguityAndBoundaryAudit":"精確到 0.1 mm，無額外四捨五入。","difficultyReason":"小數平方根與雙側公差。","literacyContextNecessity":"此情境資訊不可刪除且會改變答案，因為材料公差的兩側偏差使 ± 兩根都有實際意義。","authoringIntent":"求公差兩側厚度","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","replacementMarker":"REPLACE_MATCHING_LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY_DURING_FINAL_GLOBAL_INTEGRATION","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"7c8d5554f553e732c9b95e570e2cf4fc3fd10201a5c962e0ee15aa682ee59af7"}
